      "note_text": "The longitudinal extract includes warfarin (warfarin sodium 5 MG Oral Tablet) for a recorded indication. Other products: aspirin 81 MG Oral Tablet; warfarin sodium 5 MG Oral Tablet. There was no chronic daily bleeding at baseline. Overt bleeding began within the day before arrival and was not the patient's usual pattern. No new nonsteroidal drug was identified. The bleeding itself was the acute event on chronic anticoagulation. Heart rate was 114 and blood pressure was 96/58. Hemoglobin was 9.2 g/dL. INR was 2.7. Warfarin was held.",
